---
source: crates/ym-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"lenses\"])"
---
Show the lenses that `ym render --lens` can give a photo

Usage: ym lenses [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List the lenses with their ids, names, lines, starting amounts and the design each was computed from
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
